WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.015 --> 00:00:19.252
In More → Appearance, set the background to Photo and open Change by Date

2
00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:38.383
Tap Add Date, choose a month and day, and pick that day's photo

3
00:00:38.383 --> 00:01:02.443
Add other dates, each with its own photo

4
00:01:02.443 --> 00:01:07.556
Turn it on. Each date's photo becomes the background when that day arrives

5
00:01:07.556 --> 00:01:20.133
Go back and tap Save to apply it
